  ('GLG 331', 'Stratigraphy', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Geology', '300 Level', 'first', 2, '', '[]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Physical Sciences course catalogue (2014/2015)'),
  ('PHY 331', 'Thermal Physics', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Geology', '300 Level', 'first', 2, 'First and second laws of thermodynamics and its applications, reversible and irreversible processes, Carnot''s cycle, heat engines, isothermal and adiabatic expansion. Thermodynamic potentials, Maxwell''s relations. Entropy, Third law of thermodynamics. Joule-Kelvin effect, refrigeration. Equation of state of perfect gas; Maxwell-Boltzmann statistics; Partition function; Equipartition theorem. Low temperature Physics. Black body radiation.

Prerequisite: PHY 122', '["First and second laws of thermodynamics and its applications, reversible and irreversible processes, Carnot''s cycle, heat engines, isothermal and adiabatic expansion", "Thermodynamic potentials, Maxwell''s relations", "Entropy, Third law of thermodynamics", "Joule-Kelvin effect, refrigeration", "Equation of state of perfect gas", "Maxwell-Boltzmann statistics", "Partition function", "Equipartition theorem", "Low temperature Physics", "Black body radiation"]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Physical Sciences course catalogue (2014/2015)'),
  ('COS 201', 'Computer Programming I', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Geology', '300 Level', 'first', 2, 'Printed in this table as "Computer Programming 11"; every other appearance of COS 201 in this document titles it Computer Programming I, used here.', '[]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Physical Sciences course catalogue (2014/2015)'),
  ('PHY 251', 'Electromagnetic Waves', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Geology', '300 Level', 'first', 3, 'Elective. Electrostatics. Gauss'' Law. Fields of charge distribution, methods of images. Dielectrics, Polarization. Electric current, current density. D.C. network theory. Ampere''s Law, magnetic fields of simple circuits. Faraday''s law of induction, self and mutual inductances, inductively coupled circuits. Transients in capacitive and inductive circuits. A.C. circuit analysis. Magnetization and hysteresis. Permanent magnetism - Diamagnetism, Paramagnetism and ferromagnetism. Lorentz force. Hall Effect. Maxwell''s equation - electromagnetic waves.

Prerequisite: PHY 118 or PHY 124', '["Electrostatics", "Gauss'' Law", "Fields of charge distribution, methods of images", "Dielectrics, Polarization", "Electric current, current density", "D.C", "Network theory", "Ampere''s Law, magnetic fields of simple circuits", "Faraday''s law of induction, self and mutual inductances, inductively coupled circuits", "Transients in capacitive and inductive circuits", "A.C", "Circuit analysis", "Magnetization and hysteresis", "Permanent magnetism - Diamagnetism, Paramagnetism and ferromagnetism", "Lorentz force", "Hall Effect", "Maxwell''s equation - electromagnetic waves"]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Physical Sciences course catalogue (2014/2015)'),
  ('ECE 331', 'Electromagnetic Fields and Waves', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Geology', '300 Level', 'first', 3, 'Elective.', '[]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Physical Sciences course catalogue (2014/2015)'),
  ('ZOO 301', 'General Vertebrate Zoology', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Geology', '300 Level', 'first', 3, 'Elective.', '[]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Physical Sciences course catalogue (2014/2015)'),
  ('CHM 311', 'Physical and Structural Chemistry I', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Geology', '300 Level', 'first', 2, 'Elective.', '[]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Physical Sciences course catalogue (2014/2015)'),
  ('CVE 342', 'Soil Mechanics', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Geology', '300 Level', 'second', 3, 'Elective.', '[]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Physical Sciences course catalogue (2014/2015)'),
  ('COS 202', 'Computer Programming II', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Geology', '300 Level', 'second', 2, 'Elective.', '[]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Physical Sciences course catalogue (2014/2015)'),
  ('MTH 216', 'Elementary Differential Equations I', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Geology', '300 Level', 'second', 3, 'Elective. Representations of linear transformations by matrices, change of bases, equivalence and similarity. Determinants. Eigenvalues and eigenvectors. Minimum and characteristic polynomials of a linear transformation. Cayley-Hamilton theorem, bilinear and quadratic forms, orthogonal diagonalization. Canonical forms.', '["Representations of linear transformations by matrices, change of bases, equivalence and similarity", "Determinants", "Eigenvalues and eigenvectors", "Minimum and characteristic polynomials of a linear transformation", "Cayley-Hamilton theorem, bilinear and quadratic forms, orthogonal diagonalization", "Canonical forms"]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Physical Sciences course catalogue (2014/2015)'),
  ('STA 341', 'Sampling Theory and Survey Methods', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Geology', '400 Level', 'first', 2, 'Elective. Basic sample selection procedures. Estimation of population mean, total and proportions in simple random sampling with and without replacement. Use of auxiliary information: ratio, regression and difference estimators. Stratification: Estimation of mean total population in stratified random sampling. Sample size allocation. Cluster sampling. Two stage Cluster sampling with clusters of equal sizes. Data collection in social investigations. Methods of social investigations. Planning of surveys. Methods of collecting information. Questionnaire design. Response errors, processing analysis and presentation of data.', '["Basic sample selection procedures", "Estimation of population mean, total and proportions in simple random sampling with and without replacement", "Use of auxiliary information: ratio, regression and difference estimators", "Stratification: Estimation of mean total population in stratified random sampling", "Sample size allocation", "Cluster sampling", "Two stage Cluster sampling with clusters of equal sizes", "Data collection in social investigations", "Methods of social investigations", "Planning of surveys", "Methods of collecting information", "Questionnaire design", "Response errors, processing analysis and presentation of data"]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Physical Sciences course catalogue (2014/2015)'),
  ('CVE 221', 'Fluid Mechanics', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Geology', '400 Level', 'first', 3, 'Elective. The programme table''s left edge is cut off by the book''s binding, printing only "E 221" for this code; CVE 221 (Civil Engineering) is used as the closest plausible match for a Fluid Mechanics elective, but this is not independently confirmed.', '[]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Physical Sciences course catalogue (2014/2015)'),
  ('PHY 351', 'Electronics', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Geology', '400 Level', 'first', 2, 'Elective. Electronic device characteristics, equivalent circuit; various types of amplifiers, frequency and phase response, distortion, feedback oscillators. Semi-conductor theory and devices, characteristics; Lasers and Masers; four terminal network; equivalent circuits. Communication systems; modulation, a.m., f.m., single side band; demodulation. Elements of logic circuitry. Analog to digital conversion. Computers.

Prerequisite: PHY 251', '["Electronic device characteristics, equivalent circuit", "Various types of amplifiers, frequency and phase response, distortion, feedback oscillators", "Semi-conductor theory and devices, characteristics", "Lasers and Masers", "Four terminal network", "Equivalent circuits", "Communication systems", "Modulation, a.m., f.m., single side band", "Demodulation", "Elements of logic circuitry", "Analog to digital conversion", "Computers"]'::jsonb, 'Faculty of Physical Sciences course catalogue (2014/2015)');
